### Demo scenario for the partner commission system.
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and JetBrains HTTP Client. Everything goes through the gateway.
### Start the stack first:  docker compose up --build

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@run = demo1

### 1. Create users
POST {{gateway}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "boss-{{run}}" }

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "lead-{{run}}" }

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "agent-{{run}}" }

### 2. Partner links: agent <- lead <- boss
PUT {{gateway}}/api/users/lead-{{run}}/partner
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partnerExternalId": "boss-{{run}}" }

###
PUT {{gateway}}/api/users/agent-{{run}}/partner
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partnerExternalId": "lead-{{run}}" }

### 2a. A cycle is rejected (422)
PUT {{gateway}}/api/users/boss-{{run}}/partner
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partnerExternalId": "agent-{{run}}" }

### 3. Tree: the branch above and below a user
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/agent-{{run}}/tree?direction=up&depth=10

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/boss-{{run}}/tree?direction=down&depth=10

### 4. Current commission scheme (Linear or Fibonacci)
GET {{gateway}}/api/admin/schema

### 5. Send a profit event for the agent (202 = accepted into Kafka; calculation is asynchronous)
POST {{gateway}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "evt-1-{{run}}", "userExternalId": "agent-{{run}}", "profit": 1000 }

### 5a. The same event again: accepted, but commissions are NOT accrued twice
POST {{gateway}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "evt-1-{{run}}", "userExternalId": "agent-{{run}}", "profit": 1000 }

### 5b. A loss: stored, but it produces no commissions
POST {{gateway}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "evt-2-{{run}}", "userExternalId": "agent-{{run}}", "profit": -300 }

### 6. Events of a user (no commission details) and one event with all its commissions
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/agent-{{run}}/events?page=1&size=20

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/events/evt-1-{{run}}

### 7. Switch the scheme. Only NEW events use it; old commissions keep their schema_type.
PUT {{gateway}}/api/admin/schema
Content-Type: application/json

{ "schema": "Fibonacci" }

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "evt-3-{{run}}", "userExternalId": "agent-{{run}}", "profit": 1000 }

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/events/evt-3-{{run}}

### 7a. Switch back
PUT {{gateway}}/api/admin/schema
Content-Type: application/json

{ "schema": "Linear" }

### 8. Wallets. Commissions are paid into wallets periodically (every 10 s in docker-compose).
GET {{gateway}}/api/wallets/boss-{{run}}/balance

### 8a. Trigger a payout round right now instead of waiting
POST {{gateway}}/api/admin/payouts/run

### 8b. Payout history: which commissions were paid, and when
GET {{gateway}}/api/wallets/boss-{{run}}/payouts

### 9. After the payout the commissions of the event are marked as paid
GET {{gateway}}/api/events/evt-1-{{run}}
